Each fault is named once, with its evidence. The root cause is an HTTP-layer slowdown in `search` on its calls to `rate`.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "search",
      "fault_kind": "http_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6 p50ms, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name IN ('rate.Rate/GetRates','search.Search/Nearby') GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "search's client span to rate.GetRates has p50 about 1979 ms, while rate's server span is about 0.7 ms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.5)/1e6 p50ms, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='search' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY span_name ORDER BY span_name",
          "claim": "Only search's rate.GetRates client calls are slow (p95 about 2722 ms); its geo.Geo/Nearby calls stay at about 0.5 ms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95ms FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='search' AND attr_span_kind='Client' AND span_name='rate.Rate/GetRates' GROUP BY span_name",
          "claim": "In the normal period the same search-to-rate client calls had p95 of about 8 ms."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "search",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, approx_quantile(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE (service_name='frontend' AND attr_span_kind='Server') OR (service_name='search' AND attr_span_kind='Server') GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1,2",
          "claim": "frontend's HTTP /hotels server p95 rises to about 2743 ms, matching search.Search/Nearby server p95 of about 2723 ms."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

